9. Difference Between Resource vs Data Source
Feature	Resource	Data Source
Creates Infrastructure	✅ Yes	❌ No
Reads Existing Infra	❌ No	✅ Yes
Managed by Terraform	✅ Yes	❌ No
Example	EC2 creation	Get existing VPC
Example:

Create VPC:

resource "aws_vpc" "main" {}
Fetch VPC:

data "aws_vpc" "main" {}
